# ──── Shared defaults for every host ───────────────────────────────────────
# Managed by chezmoi (dotfiles: home/private_dot_ssh/config.d/00-common).
# Included from the TOP of ~/.ssh/config, and ssh takes the FIRST value it sees
# for a keyword — so anything here OVERRIDES the per-host blocks below it.
# Only put settings whose value is already uniform across every host; host
# aliases, FQDNs and IPs stay machine-local in ~/.ssh/config. All platforms.
Host *
  ServerAliveInterval 30           # avoid idle disconnects; was repeated in ~24 blocks
